## Model card

- **Name:** MiMo V2.6 Flash
- **Short description:** Xiaomi’s MiMo-V2.6-Flash is a full-modality, high-efficiency reasoning model positioned for high-frequency calls, large-scale tasks, and agent workflows with a 1M-token context window.
- **Provider / access:** Xiaomi MiMo API/platform (`mimo-v2.6-flash`) via `https://api.xiaomimimo.com/v1` (per official model page). Local metadata lists `xiaomi/mimo-v2.6-flash` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release date and knowledge cutoff not clearly extracted from the reviewed model page in this pass.
- **IDs:** `mimo-v2.6-flash`.
- **Context window:** 1M tokens context; 128K max output (Xiaomi MiMo model page).
- **Modalities:** Input modalities text, image, video, audio; output text (Xiaomi MiMo model page).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** USD pricing listed as $0.0028 / 1M input (cache hit), $0.14 / 1M input (cache miss), $0.28 / 1M output (Xiaomi MiMo model page).
- **Architecture:** Detailed public architecture/parameter breakdown not fully specified on the reviewed page; local metadata describes 309B/15B-active omni-modal MoE (not independently verified from page text).

